WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.835
Cat hid in Tom's pocket.

2
00:00:14.836 --> 00:00:18.185
Dirk sank into a chair.

3
00:00:18.186 --> 00:00:22.413
"He looks sick," Tom thought.

4
00:00:22.414 --> 00:00:27.781
Then Dirk's daughter came in.

5
00:00:27.782 --> 00:00:30.924
She was carrying a tray.

6
00:00:30.925 --> 00:00:35.798
"Here's your milk and toast, Father," Ann said.

7
00:00:35.799 --> 00:00:42.357
Dirk clutched his stomach and moaned.

8
00:00:42.358 --> 00:00:47.241
"It's not easy being the head servant around here.

9
00:00:47.242 --> 00:00:55.436
Especially when a dragon attacks the palace!"

10
00:00:55.437 --> 00:01:00.266
Ann patted him on the shoulder.

11
00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:04.495
"Try some milk and toast.

12
00:01:04.496 --> 00:01:13.966
It's good for an upset stomach."

13
00:01:13.967 --> 00:01:16.169
Tom stepped forward.

14
00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:18.111
"Can I help?"

15
00:01:18.112 --> 00:01:21.420
"No!" Dirk glared at Tom.

16
00:01:21.421 --> 00:01:31.022
"My daughter should be the royal wizard. Not you!"

17
00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:33.962
"Father," Ann said softly.

18
00:01:33.963 --> 00:01:36.026
"I don't want to be the—"

19
00:01:36.027 --> 00:01:42.992
"You will be the royal wizard one day," Dirk snapped.

20
00:01:42.993 --> 00:01:46.234
"I have to get back to the roof," Dirk said.

21
00:01:46.235 --> 00:01:54.390
He put down his milk and left.

22
00:01:54.391 --> 00:02:00.499
Tom sighed. "Your father hates me."

23
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:04.748
"He wants me to be the royal wizard," Ann said.

24
00:02:04.749 --> 00:02:08.705
"But you're a fine wizard, Tom."

25
00:02:08.706 --> 00:02:10.549
Tom shook his head.

26
00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:13.467
"No, I'm not."

27
00:02:13.468 --> 00:02:16.279
"Yes, you are," Ann said.

28
00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:19.188
"Show me a spell."

29
00:02:19.189 --> 00:02:25.626
"Okay." Tom waved his wand.

30
00:02:25.627 --> 00:02:30.767
Poof! Roses appeared.

31
00:02:30.768 --> 00:02:36.969
Tom grinned and gave them to Ann.

32
00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:41.686
"See?" she said. "Thank you."

33
00:02:41.687 --> 00:02:44.515
"You're welcome," Tom said.

34
00:02:44.516 --> 00:02:51.114
"Now I'm going to fight that dragon!"

